'''Kaalgrontiid''' is a colossal green [[ON:Dragon|dragon]] who was imprisoned by [[Online:Khunzar-ri|Khunzar-ri]] in the [[ON:Halls of Colossus|Halls of Colossus]] long ago. Locked behind a magically sealed door at the Summit of Rending Flames, [[ON:Captain Martio Calsivius|Captain Calsivius]] attempts to break the seal to control him for [[Online:Euraxia Tharn|Euraxia Tharn]], and after he is killed, [[ON:Abnur Tharn|Abnur Tharn]] combines the [[Lore:Wrathstone|Wrathstone]] to undo the spell. However, the door is opened, and Kaalgrontiid emerges from the depths before flying off into [[Online:Northern Elsweyr|Northern Elsweyr]].

Kaalgrontiid then leads his fellow dragons on a destructive tear across Elsweyr, seemingly in search for something. He is allied by the [[ON:Euraxians|Euraxians]] through his second-in-command, [[ON:Mulaamnir|Mulaamnir]], and trusted soldier, [[ON:Bahlokdaan|Bahlokdaan]]. It's up to you and the defenders of Elsweyr to find out what he is searching for, and stop him.
