==Dragon Rage Trailer==
In the [https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=RDHC2LSFxvk Dragon Rage] trailer, Kaalgrontiid says the following:

:''"We are free my brothers. Free to ravage this realm, to finish what we started... so long ago."''
:''"We shall take from this land, what is rightfully ours."''
:''"No mortal can oppose us."''
:''"And let all those who dare... die."''
:''"Now is the hour of our fury, and the beginning of our reign."''
:''"Nothing can defeat... a Rage of Dragons!"''

==Notes==
* He is seen in the cinematic teaser trailer for ''[[ON:Elsweyr|The Elder Scrolls Online: Elsweyr]]''.
* His name is translated directly as Champion-Bind-Time, or ''"Champion of the Bound Time"'' according to [[ON:Cadwell|Cadwell]].
** It was spelled as "Kellegraantiid" on some parts of the official website, which may have been a working name that was changed later on.

